# Public site i18n

SolarFarms.cy is English, Greek (`el`), and Russian (`ru`).

- Put every new user-visible string in `messages/en.json` first.
- Add the same key to `messages/el.json` and `messages/ru.json` in the same commit.
- Render with `useTranslations()` (client) or `getTranslations()` (server). Do not hardcode public copy.
- Link with `LocaleLink` so `/el` and `/ru` prefixes are kept.
- Run `npm run i18n:check` — catalogs must have identical keys.
- Do not translate CRM, tablet, admin, or other internal tools.
- Keep proper nouns (Lighthief, SolarFarms.cy, TSOC, EAC, BESS, EPC, O&M) and figures unchanged.
